<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">TEMPLATE LIBRARY</view><view class="title">好用的格式，<br/>留给下一次。</view><view class="subtitle">保存常用字段与规则，避免重复录入。</view><view class="notice">当前支持字段与条款预设。保存时清空实际编号、日期和交易方；Word / Excel 版式导入将在后续接入。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="muted">当前业务</view><view class="name">{{activeName || '尚未选择业务'}}</view><button class="primary" style="margin-top:24rpx" bindtap="saveCurrent">从当前业务保存模板</button></view><view wx:if="{{!templates.length}}" class="card empty">尚未保存模板<view class="meta">在业务中填写常用栏目后，即可保存。</view></view><view wx:for="{{templates}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="name grow">{{item.name}}</view><text class="tag">V{{item.version}}</text></view><view class="meta">{{item.clauses.length}} 个自定义栏目 · 动态值留空</view><view wx:for="{{item.clauses}}" wx:for-item="clause" wx:key="fieldId" class="meta">{{clause.name}} · {{clause.required ? '必填' : '选填'}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="apply">应用到当前业务</button><button class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view></view>
